- Update to version 1.4.0
    + Refactor main.py into separate modules                                               
      * cli.py — argument parsing and mode dispatch                                        
      * pipeline.py — domain/hostname/username extraction helpers
      * audit.py — mapping I/O, audit trail, reports                                       
