      * Boolean flags, pool ranges, paths all type-checked                                 
    + Bug fixes                                                                            
      * Version strings like 0.8.9.0 no longer matched as IPs                              
    + Unit test suite                                                                      
      * tests covering all scrubbers, processor, and config   

